---
manual: image.scaled_height
lines: [2630, 2635]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: A4
expect: fail
reason: Lacci's height reads the height style, which is nil when only width is given; nothing feeds the shown size back (A4, Lacci change unscheduled).
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 200, height: 200 do
  @thumb = image "assets/checker-20x20.png", width: 50
end
----------- test code
# The manual's 150x150 image styled to width 50, with our 20x20 square image.
assert_equal 50, image("@thumb").height, "height is the height shown right now, 50"
